 "comment": "Backing Rhythm style library. Every pattern is written on the General MIDI percussion map (note 36 = Bass Drum, 38 = Snare, 42 = Closed Hi-Hat…) and rendered against a GM drum kit from Sounds/GM Drum Kits. Step strings: '.' = rest, 'g' = ghost, 'o' = soft, 'x' = normal, 'X' = accent. Each track's string is bars × beatsPerBar × stepsPerBeat characters long. 'swing' (0…0.33) delays every off-beat subdivision by that fraction of a subdivision pair — 0.167 is a triplet feel. 'tempo' is the style's suggested BPM; playback follows the app tempo.",
